Period of time where a system is unavailable for its intended use due to system failures, ongoing software updates, or other unexpected issues.

How it is Used

Sometimes, downtime is planned, such as during the scheduled maintenance of a web application. The County's IT Strategic Plan FY24-26 outlines a goal of having 99.95% uptime of infrastructure to ensure County services remain accessible.";}s:8:"relation";a:2:{s:10:"references";a:1:{s:23:"glossary:data_migration";b:1;}s:10:"firstimage";s:0:"";}s:8:"internal";a:2:{s:5:"cache";b:1;s:3:"toc";b:1;}}s:10:"persistent";a:5:{s:4:"date";a:2:{s:7:"created";i:1744784424;s:8:"modified";i:1744833559;}s:7:"creator";s:11:"Aditya Seth";s:4:"user";s:5:"admin";s:11:"last_change";a:9:{s:4:"date";i:1744833559;s:2:"ip";s:14:"73.235.164.232";s:4:"type";s:1:"E";s:2:"id";s:17:"glossary:downtime";s:4:"user";s:5:"admin";s:3:"sum";s:0:"";s:5:"extra";s:0:"";s:10:"sizechange";i:30;s:4:"mode";s:4:"page";}s:11:"contributor";a:1:{s:5:"admin";s:11:"Aditya Seth";}}}